---
import Entry from '../layouts/Entry.astro';
import SiteSymbol from '../components/SiteSymbol.astro';
---

<Entry title="Move your saved browser data" eyebrow="Charitology" summary="Open tools on the old address to export work saved in this browser." crumbs={[{ label: 'Move your saved browser data' }]}>
  <ol>
    <li><SiteSymbol name="monitor" size="inline" /> <strong>Open the old address.</strong> Use the same browser profile where you saved your work. <a href="https://charitology.org/tools/?legacy=1">Open the tools on charitology.org</a>.</li>
    <li><SiteSymbol name="download" size="inline" /> <strong>Save a copy.</strong> Open the tool you used. If it offers a backup or export, save the file.</li>
    <li><SiteSymbol name="packet" size="inline" /> <strong>Restore the copy.</strong> <a href="https://charitology.com/tools/">Open the same tool on charitology.com</a> and use its import or restore control.</li>
  </ol>
  <p>The old address stays open in this browser for one hour after you use the link. The old address reads records saved under .org. Exporting creates a copy. Open <a href="https://os.charitology.org/app">the hosted Charity OS</a> to access your organization workspace.</p>
</Entry>
